      "text": "Caleb … hath followed me fully, Num. 14:24. love the Lord thy God with all thine heart, and with all thy soul, and with all thy might, Deut. 6:5 (Mark 12:30; Moro. 10:32). serve the Lord thy God with all thy heart, Deut. 10:12 (D&C 4:2). keep and do them with all thine heart, Deut. 26:16 (Josh. 22:1–7). choose you this day whom ye will serve, Josh. 24:15 (24:14–25). she was steadfastly minded to go with her, Ruth 1:18. serve him in truth with all your heart, 1 Sam. 12:24. covenant … to walk after the Lord, 2 Kgs. 23:3. Commit thy way unto the Lord, Ps. 37:5. his heart is fixed, trusting in the Lord, Ps. 112:7. With my whole heart have I sought thee, Ps. 119:10. Daniel purposed in his heart that he would not defile, Dan. 1:8. turn ye even to me with all your heart, Joel 2:12.",
